{
    "title": "Daily Bible Devotion & Prayer",
    "description": "Daily Bible Devotion is a free app that brings you daily Bible verses & religious inspirational devotions. Receive a morning and an evening Bible verse and devotional for every day of the year.\r\n\r\nStart and end your day meditating on God\u2019s word with daily Bible devotionals that are easy to understand and that you can apply to your life. To deepen your devotional readings, receive Bible trivia each day with questions that help you engage with and memorize Bible scripture followed by clean Bible humor to brighten your day.\r\n\r\nDaily Bible Devotion Features:\r\n* Encouraging Bible verse with each devotional\r\n* A new Bible devotional is delivered to you every day, twice a day\r\n* Light and dark mode\r\n* Each devotion is short and uplifting\r\n* Each devotional comes with a way to apply it to your life\r\n* Share any devotional with your friends and family\r\n* New Bible trivia each day to test your Bible knowledge\r\n* Bible humor to bring laughter to your day\r\n* Save your favorite devotionals to read later or to reference\r\n* Get notified when the devotionals are available\r\n\r\nAs a Christian, growing your personal relationship with God is important. But for those people we know who aren't church-goers, the daily devotionals can easily be shared with anyone! We encourage you to share your favorite Bible devotions with family and friends.\r\n\r\nA great way to receive your daily bread and encourage you to develop your spiritual life through praise and prayer. Remember, you will also get a life application for each Bible verse and scripture!\r\n\r\nThe Daily Bible Devotion app allows you to select your preferred Bible version translation.\r\nBible versions include:\r\nNew Living Translation (NLT) Bible version\r\nKing James Version (KJV) Bible version\r\nNew International Version (NIV) Bible version\r\n\r\nSelect the \"moon\" \ud83c\udf19  icon to switch between light and dark mode to reduce strain on your eyes. Read your Bible devotion in the best settings possible with a dark background or a light background.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Daily Bible Devotion is a free app that brings you daily Bible verses &amp; religious inspirational devotions. Receive a morning and an evening Bible verse and devotional for every day of the year.<br><br>Start and end your day meditating on God\u2019s word with daily Bible devotionals that are easy to understand and that you can apply to your life. To deepen your devotional readings, receive Bible trivia each day with questions that help you engage with and memorize Bible scripture followed by clean Bible humor to brighten your day.<br><br>Daily Bible Devotion Features:<br>* Encouraging Bible verse with each devotional<br>* A new Bible devotional is delivered to you every day, twice a day<br>* Light and dark mode<br>* Each devotion is short and uplifting<br>* Each devotional comes with a way to apply it to your life<br>* Share any devotional with your friends and family<br>* New Bible trivia each day to test your Bible knowledge<br>* Bible humor to bring laughter to your day<br>* Save your favorite devotionals to read later or to reference<br>* Get notified when the devotionals are available<br><br>As a Christian, growing your personal relationship with God is important. But for those people we know who aren&#39;t church-goers, the daily devotionals can easily be shared with anyone! We encourage you to share your favorite Bible devotions with family and friends.<br><br>A great way to receive your daily bread and encourage you to develop your spiritual life through praise and prayer. Remember, you will also get a life application for each Bible verse and scripture!<br><br>The Daily Bible Devotion app allows you to select your preferred Bible version translation.<br>Bible versions include:<br>New Living Translation (NLT) Bible version<br>King James Version (KJV) Bible version<br>New International Version (NIV) Bible version<br><br>Select the &quot;moon&quot; \ud83c\udf19  icon to switch between light and dark mode to reduce strain on your eyes. Read your Bible devotion in the best settings possible with a dark background or a light background.",
